    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2123540/extras/69b805fc639b0ec19786b9fae1816e54.avif?t=1681915263\" /></div><br><br>Guitar Zeros is a narrative deck builder where your goal is to help a DIY Punk band survive their road trip on the way to the Battle of The Bands.<br>Draw cards against story situations on the road with a unique system that mashes up deck building, narrative &amp; blackjack! Hit me baby one more time!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2123540/extras/afda3d9f5eecec616ac599889b33dc5c.avif?t=1681915263\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Improve Your Band &amp; Deck</strong></h2>As with any band just starting out, you\u2019ve got your problems, and this is reflected in your deck at the beginning of the game\u2026it sucks. Beat challenges to gain powerful new cards with various effects.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story System</strong></h2>Your wins and losses are tracked to create the unique story of your band's tour.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Boss Battles of The Bands</strong></h2>Go up against rival bands, each with their own killer soundtrack and design.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2123540/extras/d18e6dd56ad182726885434e10679317.avif?t=1681915263\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2123540/extras/69b805fc639b0ec19786b9fae1816e54.avif?t=1681915263\" /></div><br><br>Guitar Zeros is a narrative deck builder where your goal is to help a DIY Punk band survive their road trip on the way to the Battle of The Bands.<br>Draw cards against story situations on the road with a unique system that mashes up deck building, narrative &amp; blackjack! Hit me baby one more time!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2123540/extras/afda3d9f5eecec616ac599889b33dc5c.avif?t=1681915263\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Improve Your Band &amp; Deck</strong></h2>As with any band just starting out, you\u2019ve got your problems, and this is reflected in your deck at the beginning of the game\u2026it sucks. Beat challenges to gain powerful new cards with various effects.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story System</strong></h2>Your wins and losses are tracked to create the unique story of your band's tour.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Boss Battles of The Bands</strong></h2>Go up against rival bands, each with their own killer soundtrack and design.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2123540/extras/d18e6dd56ad182726885434e10679317.avif?t=1681915263\" /></div>",
